{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06407","headline":"崔五六图屏风各赋一物得乌孙佩刀 · 李颀","name":"崔五六图屏风各赋一物得乌孙佩刀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌孙腰间佩两刀，刃可吹毛锦爲带。\n握手枕宿穹庐室，马上割飞翳螉塞。\n执之魍魉谁能前，气凛清风沙漠边。\n磨用阴山一片玉，洗将胡地独流泉。\n主人屏风写奇状，铁鞘金鐶俨相向。\n回头瞪目时一看，使予心在江湖上。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}